      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ExampleQueryMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>ExampleQueryMapper</code></a> given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../../core/convert/IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>和<a href=\"../../core/convert/IndexResolver.html\" title=\"接口 in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a>，创建一个新的<a href=\"ExampleQueryMapper.html\" title=\"类 in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>ExampleQueryMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve a mapped <a href=\"RedisOperationChain.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>RedisOperationChain</code></a> to query secondary indexes given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.",
      "translation": "检索一个已映射的<a href=\"RedisOperationChain.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>RedisOperationChain</code></a>，以便根据<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>查询二级索引。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This mapper creates a <a href=\"RedisOperationChain.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>RedisOperationChain</code></a> for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> considering exact matches,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.PropertyValueTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>value transformations</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.MatchMode.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher.MatchMode</code></a> for indexed simple and nested type\nproperties. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> properties are not considered.",
      "translation": "该映射器为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 创建了一个 <a href=\"RedisOperationChain.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.query\"><code>RedisOperationChain</code></a>，该映射器会考虑精确匹配、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.PropertyValueTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>值转换</code></a> 以及针对索引的简单和嵌套类型属性的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.MatchMode.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher.MatchMode</code></a>。不考虑 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> 属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
